24.22
# When updating the Node version, do the following:
# - run `nvm use` to update your local version of Node
# - run `npm pkg set "engines.node"="^$(node -v | cut -c2- )"` to update the 'engines' field in the root `package.json`
# - run `npm install @types/node@<MAJOR>` to update types. NOTE: Currently this buggily hoists the package to `dependencies`.
#   This is fixed/overwritten by the next step.
# - run `npm install` to update `package-lock.json`
# - check the `[node]` section of the various `.browserslistrc` files of the project match the major version
